PRSL-AI — MOBILE ARCHITECTURE VISUALIZATION

Design Objective:
Create a mobile-first visualization of the PRSL-AI Ecosystem that represents the architecture as an expanding interconnected universe rather than a conventional hierarchical tree.

The visualization must be optimized for smartphone screens, vertical scrolling, touch interaction, readability, and progressive exploration.

