==================================================
21. MOBILE NAVIGATION MODEL
==================================================

The mobile visualization must use progressive disclosure.

Level 1:

PRSL-AI Universe

Level 2:

Core Domains

Level 3:

Domain Architecture

Level 4:

Components

Level 5:

Implementation

The user should never be required to see the entire architecture simultaneously.

==================================================
22. MOBILE INTERACTION
==================================================

Primary interactions:

Tap
    =
Open domain

Tap again
    =
Expand subsystem

Swipe
    =
Navigate between architectural layers

Pinch
    =
Zoom architecture

Long Press
    =
Show domain description

Back
    =
Return to previous architectural level

Search
    =
Locate domain, component, provider or relationship

