24. RESPONSIVE PRINCIPLE
==================================================

Desktop:

The architecture may expand horizontally and radially.

Tablet:

The architecture may combine radial and vertical exploration.

Mobile:

The architecture becomes primarily vertical and interactive.

The underlying architecture does not change.

Only the visualization changes.

